  "build": "node scripts/build-taste-kit.mjs <checkout>/skills/taste-skill",
  "adaptations": [
    "single-document kit: system.css, cards.css, layout.css, motion.css and five moments concatenated into assets/taste.css; motion.js and the five moments bundled into assets/taste.js without dynamic import()",
    "system.js, layout.js, ui.js, effects, scenes, photo search, dealers and checker scripts omitted: they need module loading, network or a local browser",
    "remote Google fonts removed; system font stacks",
    "house rules, kind decision and product page rules condensed from SKILL.md and sections.md; kit markup written from system.md, hero-product.html and moment headers",
    "the host inlines skill:// references; pages set data-tone themselves because system.js is not included",
    "the bundled loader leaves pinned-chapters and photo-chapters static unless they sit at main > section > block, so a deviating structure never collapses to an empty screen",
    "window-parallax and giant-type-pass bundled; product-close-up added locally on the upstream moment lib; image-led page rules, imagePlan and designPlan added to the entry; transparent cut-outs removed by decision",
    "sections are content-sized instead of fixed at one or two screens (upstream needs its browser checker for that); the hero keeps at least one screen",
    "host layer appended last: a button row nested in the hero head and facts after the stage keep their places; .spec-card (product picture and rows, one media frame) and .figure-panel (drawings and charts at half width) added",
    ".range (product lineup with count-based columns and a centred last row), .spec-table (models as columns) and host.js (range frame ratio from its pictures) added to the host layer; the product-page rules point to them",
    ".feature (one product per section, alternating), .case (one shape for every case: words and figures beside a drawing and a measured chart) and shared .figures added; kit.md gives a product-page block menu that varies the blocks"
  ],
  "local": [
    {
      "path": "scripts/taste-kit/product-close-up.js",
